<mxfile host="drawio-by-hand"><diagram id="p1" name="mcp-architecture"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="0" pageWidth="1760" pageHeight="820" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="title" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:24px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;GCP Analytics RAG MCP: how the server works&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot; color=&quot;#555555&quot;&gt;A stdio process that exposes the search and a setup check as two read-only tools&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="10" width="1500" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="g_client" value="MCP client" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fffbe9;strokeColor=#d6b656;dashed=1;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=6;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="90" width="290" height="330" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="cl" value="&lt;b&gt;Claude Code / OpenCode&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;starts the process, lists the tools, calls them (tools/call, JSON-RPC over stdio) and gets the chunks back (dashed green arrow)&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="150" width="230" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="reg" value="&lt;b&gt;Registration&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;claude mcp add gcp-rag ... (command and JSON in the README)&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="290" width="230" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="g_proc" value="python -m gcp_rag_mcp  ·  one process per session" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#eef4fd;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;dashed=1;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=6;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="380" y="90" width="800" height="700" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="main" value="&lt;b&gt;__main__.py&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;reads the settings, builds the retriever and the checks, runs the server over stdio&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="410" y="150" width="340" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="cfg" value="&lt;b&gt;config.Settings&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;RAG_DATABASE_URL (default courses_bge, 5 s connect timeout) and RAG_MODEL_DIR (default ../rag/models/bge-m3)&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="810" y="150" width="340" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="t1" value="&lt;b&gt;gcp_rag_search_course&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;validates the arguments (question and translation 1 to 2000 characters, k 1 to 100); searches both phrasings; removes the path line from each text; a failure becomes a ToolError with the kind only&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="410" y="300" width="340" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="t2" value="&lt;b&gt;gcp_rag_check_setup&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;returns ready, one check per piece and the guide with where to get what is missing&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="410" y="480" width="340" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lazy" value="&lt;b&gt;retriever.LazyRetriever&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;a lock: one search at a time; loads the model and the connection on the first search; if a search fails it drops the connection and keeps the model&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="810" y="300" width="340" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="chk" value="&lt;b&gt;setup_check.run_checks&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;are the 3 model files there? does the database answer with chunks?&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="810" y="480" width="340" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="life" value="&lt;b&gt;Lifecycle&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;1. the client starts the process and lists the two tools&lt;br&gt;2. the first search loads bge-m3 (a few seconds, about 1.1 GB of RAM)&lt;br&gt;3. the next searches take about 0.1 s&lt;br&gt;4. the process ends with the session&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#eeeeee;strokeColor=#666666;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="410" y="630" width="740" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="g_out" value="Outside the server" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#eef7ee;strokeColor=#82b366;dashed=1;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=6;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1250" y="90" width="480" height="700" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="rag" value="&lt;b&gt;rag package (repo GCP-ANALYTICS_RAG)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;installed in editable mode from ../rag: HybridRetriever.search_many and Embedder&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1280" y="150" width="360" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="model" value="&lt;b&gt;models/bge-m3/&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;onnx/model_int8.onnx, tokenizer.json, config.json&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1280" y="310" width="360" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="db" value="&lt;b&gt;rag-db&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;PostgreSQL 17 + pgvector, database courses_bge (image ghcr.io/estvn/gcp-rag-db:bge-m3)&lt;/span&gt;" style="shape=cylinder3;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1280" y="470" width="360" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e1" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#444444;fontSize=11;fontColor=#444444;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.3;entryX=0;entryY=0.2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="cl" target="t1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e2" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#2e7d32;fontSize=11;fontColor=#2e7d32;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;dashed=1;exitX=0;exitY=0.7;entryX=1;entryY=0.8;" edge="1" parent="1" source="t1" target="cl"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e3" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#444444;fontSize=11;fontColor=#444444;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.8;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="cl" target="t2"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e4" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#444444;fontSize=11;fontColor=#444444;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;dashed=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="main" target="cfg"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e5" value="create_server" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#444444;fontSize=11;fontColor=#444444;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="main" target="t1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e6" value="search" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#444444;fontSize=11;fontColor=#444444;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="t1" target="lazy"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e7" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#444444;fontSize=11;fontColor=#444444;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="t2" target="chk"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e8" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#444444;fontSize=11;fontColor=#444444;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.3;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="lazy" target="rag"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e9" value="loads" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#444444;fontSize=11;fontColor=#444444;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="rag" target="model"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e10" value="SQL" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#7b4f9d;fontSize=11;fontColor=#7b4f9d;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.8;entryX=1;entryY=0.3;" edge="1" parent="1" source="rag" target="db"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e11" value="files exist?" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#444444;fontSize=11;fontColor=#444444;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;dashed=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.3;entryX=0;entryY=0.7;" edge="1" parent="1" source="chk" target="model"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e12" value="select count(*)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#7b4f9d;fontSize=11;fontColor=#7b4f9d;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;dashed=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.7;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="chk" target="db"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>